# Firebase Functions Environment Configuration
# 
# Set these using Firebase CLI commands:
# firebase functions:config:set stripe.secret="sk_live_yourSecretKeyHere"
# firebase functions:config:set stripe.webhook_secret="whsec_yourWebhookSecret"
#
# For local development, create a .env file in functions/ directory with:
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_yourTestKeyHere
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_yourTestWebhookSecret
#
# IMPORTANT: Never commit actual API keys to version control!